      "id": "732c241050a74815853ac"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n1. Symetric skewness:  mean == mediun == mode\n2. Assymetric skewness:  \n  - positive skewness:  (10,20,30,40,50,100,2000)  -> mean will departurture to bigger number:  mean>median>mode\n  - negative skewness: (80,1,70,20,40,2,4,7)  -> mode > median > mean",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "de88dfcd6acd40f8938ec"
    },
