    {
      "text": "\n### Salting\n\n- Adding randomness to distribute uneven data evently\n- salt_number = 3 , meaning assigning number b/w (0 to 3) 3 exculded \n- and join along with key and sal column\n- during exchange will now do hash(key,saltedcol)%shuffle_partiions",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "1f585208c2e843b8a8187"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\n//sort merge join without broadcast\nval join_tran_cust_df = transactionDF.join(customerDF, Seq(\"cust_id\"), \"inner\")",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
