          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "68487d8ad5614aaa95117"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n1.  read both data sets  -> exchange by key  into 200 shuflle partion \n2. Aqe Shuffle read:  read the shuffle (200 ) partitions and coalesec the partitons\n2.  broadcast exchange single partions (which ever is smaller <= 10 mb>) \n3. join happens on the executors (less shuffle read and write)\n\n\n![img](files/tables/suankiData/raw/images/DAG_AQE.png)",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
