    {
      "text": "\n### Solving DATA Sqew with \n- BroadcastJoin\n- Adaptive query Execution\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
