    {
      "text": "%spark\nval data = Seq(\n  (101, \"imps\", 10),\n  (103, \"neft\", 50),\n  (201, \"imps\", 40),\n  (101, \"upi\",  20)\n)\n\n\nval df = data.toDF(\"trid\",\"type\",\"amnt\")\n\ndf.show()\n\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "6ea86fd98ec346909ca24"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\nspark.conf.set(\"spark.sql.autoBroadcastJoinThreshold\",\"10M\")\nspark.conf.set(\"spark.sql.adaptive.enabled\",false)",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "c14979e367ff43639658a"
    },
    {
      "text": "### How AQE works\n\n![img](files/tables/suankiData/raw/images/spark_AQE_steps.png)\n\n\n1. read run time statistics of data actually no of bytes read and no of partions\n2. tune shuffle partitons based on distinct keys and coalesce the partions, suppose we have only 15 distinct key it would coalesce 200 to 15 partions\n3.  convert sort merge join to Broadcast join\n4. optimize skew joins by breaking bigger partions into smaller one\n\n\n[optimize skew joins](https://spark.apache.org/docs/3.5.1/sql-performance-tuning.html#adaptive-query-execution)\n\n```spark.sql.adaptive.skewJoin.enabled\nspark.sql.adaptive.skewJoin.skewedPartitionFactor\nspark.sql.adaptive.skewJoin.skewedPartitionThresholdInBytes\nspark.sql.adaptive.forceOptimizeSkewedJoin```\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "fb3b7281772645cb9de51"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\n//before we do join lets look at the data \ntransactionDF.groupBy(\"cust_id\")\n.agg(countDistinct(\"txn_id\").alias(\"ct\"))\n.orderBy(desc(\"ct\"))\n.show(5,false)",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
