      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "11e59152ff5e43f88972a"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "da3367f85f0548529477d"
    },
    {
      "text": "1. [What is mean , median, mode](https://www.khanacademy.org/math/cc-sixth-grade-math/cc-6th-data-statistics/mean-and-median/v/mean-median-and-mode)\n2. [What is skewness and kurtosis of data](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=deoph-Rfc24&list=PLRNL7AjA6rjx0L7i1QRCJXNhdujE0mkDr)\n3. [solution to skewness](https://medium.com/@diehardankush/how-to-understanding-data-skewness-in-apache-spark-9e93b9a68f46#id_token=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6ImU0YWRmYjQzNmI5ZTE5N2UyZTExMDZhZjJjODQyMjg0ZTQ5ODZhZmYiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..ns7Ple09BIqAyir-DEWTni6hqra62-WTSYfXV7cka51uIJ7xvtb_VTqdRxUC4RzZyE9bf946k77lzoI5BBd7VInji-WL-TunYBLtYkMA_sN9NLtSj-tqgDWQqP-BVef1fNFLanG4Y3sb0XOoeAWEfdTVHHctSWkwD9gz88o5nFKiv44V3rzaLvGbeiE6TFPafAkrRDnQWr-y2EPKqt07VgNR7S5HYUNexsHqPFVCqhNQRStYykHc-umxD3NbfJ5vCQ9ndDDbPQCRAuvqL2r36hTgM5OFs9E864DoYufY9fE1F2HhtHRo-zWjvh2aUqK_BdK7-HKa2xs5sKM5M4xW9Q)\n\n\nStatics : mean , meadian, mode\n\nexample1:  4, 3, 1, 6, 1,7\n\n1. Arithmetic mean  it's like avg of data\n*It is a measure of the center of a data set*\n  - => (4 +3 +3 +1 +6 + 1 + 7) /6 = 22/6 = 3.6\n\n2. median (central tendency)->  1 1 **3 4** 6 7   => 3.5   //mean of middle number is median =>3 + 4/2  => 3.5 \n   - 0, 7, 50, 100000, 100000   //median is 50  can be calucalte \n\n3. mode(most common number in the dataset)  -> so answer is 1 for above datasets  \n\n\nexample:  we have different transaction for a diffrent cutomer\n\n```\n    cust    transaction   typeOfTransaction  transactionAmount\n     a      4567          neft                +200\n     a      6868          imps                -300\n     a      3833           balance inquirey    0\n     b      3434          imps                 +2000  \n     b      2342           balance inquirey    0\n     c      6546868        imps                +456546\n     c      3824333        balance inquirey    0\n```\ndf.groupBy(cust).agg( mean(transactionAmount), mod(transactionAmount), midian(transactionAmount))\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "e04b6dddf62943759bacd"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n#### Broadcast join",
